	(text "SOM is a black box (Rule 7). Every pin, voltage level and sequence comes from the SOM\nmanufacturer documentation, never from the QCS8550 SoC datasheet. SOM MPN: TBD (ADR-0002).\nPER_3V3 / PER_1V8 are not connected here until the SOM documents its IO domains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 34.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
